01:56:10.400 --> 01:56:17.960
Antônio Gomir, Bia de Lima, Mauro Rubem,
Anderson Teodoro, Gugu Nader, Eduardo Prado, Major Araújo,

01:56:18.080 --> 01:56:24.040
Paulo César Martins, Caio Salim, Wilde
